Exception: brand assets (Anipair name, logo, and the characters Ani and Pair)

The MIT License above applies to the source code only. It does NOT apply to
the following brand assets, which are Copyright (c) 2026 manato003,
All rights reserved:

  - the name "Anipair" and its logo (the logo mark and the logotype)
  - the characters "Ani" (アニ) and "Pair" (ペア): their designs,
    illustrations, names, and profiles

These assets appear in, among others: src/components/Mascot.tsx,
src/features/settings/MascotProfile.tsx, public/logo-mark.svg,
public/logo-mark-on-dark.svg, public/favicon.svg, public/icon-*.png,
public/apple-touch-icon.png, the illustration in index.html, and
screenshots/.

You may not use, copy, modify, or distribute these assets without prior
written permission. If you publish a fork or a derived work, replace them
with your own name, logo, and artwork.

